Upstream bug: retrieving or cancelling a native background Response changes
its client-visible ID by encrypting the provider response ID again.

https://github.com/BerriAI/litellm/issues/17204

Preserve the client-visible response ID across retrieval and cancellation.

Removal check: tests/verify_background.py

diff --git a/litellm/proxy/response_api_endpoints/endpoints.py b/litellm/proxy/response_api_endpoints/endpoints.py
--- a/litellm/proxy/response_api_endpoints/endpoints.py
+++ b/litellm/proxy/response_api_endpoints/endpoints.py
@@ -930,6 +930,8 @@ async def get_response(
         fastapi_response=fastapi_response,
         read_settles_billing=read_settles_billing,
     )
+    if isinstance(response, ResponsesAPIResponse):
+        response.id = response_id
     return response


@@ -1974,6 +1976,8 @@ async def cancel_response(
         fastapi_response=fastapi_response,
         read_settles_billing=read_settles_billing,
     )
+    if isinstance(response, ResponsesAPIResponse):
+        response.id = response_id
     return response
